OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in 'hate crime'
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fbeing stabbed in Belfast on Saturday
OL,8,Fmorning.
OL,10,FThe incident happened in the
OL,11,FCliftonpark Avenue area between 07:30
OL,12,Fand 07:45 GMT.
OL,14,FPolice understand the victim was out
OL,15,Ffor a walk when three men confronted
OL,16,Fhim. An altercation then ensued and the
OL,17,Fvictim was stabbed in the chest.
OL,19,FThe attack is being treated as a hate
OL,20,Fcrime by police.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
